        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "The field is divided into halves. The left; upper and lower case script alphabets plus numbers above and gothic alphabet. Beneath this are horizontal rows with various floral vine and other motives. The right; houses, a wreath with the initials \"M.T.\", various floral grouping and animals scattered over the ground.  Stains; missing yarns.  Stitches:  counted satin, cross, feather, long-armed cross, plush."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/3cd93126-f037-3887-9b8f-29ffec54aa1e> ;
